{
  "id": "affinity_ritual",
  "title": "Elemental Affinity Ritual",
  "item": "omnira:light_microcore",
  "scene": "affinity_ritual",
  "recipes": false,
  "text": [
    "Place an Advanced Ritual Energy Core in the center. On eight Crystal Pedestals, place one each of the Earth, Water, Fire, Air, Light and Dark Microcores, Paradox Dust and Dream Crystal Budding Rock, in any order.",
    "Choose an activator from the affinity tables. Use it on the core and stay inside the circle for six seconds. Forming a bond lifts you into the air. To renounce it, repeat the ritual with the same activator. You may move within the circle during renunciation.",
    "Completion consumes one activator, including the entire Analysis Crystal. An interrupted ritual consumes nothing. The pedestal offerings can be retrieved once the ritual starts.",
    "You can hold one affinity at a time, and it persists through death. A new bond can form once the renunciation penalty ends. Logging out pauses the timer. Death ends ongoing penalties except for Chaos.",
    "Light, Dark and Fourfold trigger only with sufficient mana. Their costs are fixed. A Star of Fulfillment waives the current affinity’s renunciation penalty. Its triggered abilities still cost mana.",
    "{dream}Rumor speaks of a powerful and dangerous Dream Affinity..."
  ],
